<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17139" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀτόλμ-ητος</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀτόλμ-ᾱτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄτλητος</span>
			, <i>not to be endured, insufferable,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μόχθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>I.</u>
					8(7).11
				</span></i>
			; of men, dub. in <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				375
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>not to be dared,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδὲν [τοῖς ποιηταῖς] ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aristid.
					<u>Or.</u>
					45(8).2
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				8.260
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ πλουσίῳ οὐδὲν ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Him.
					<u>Ecl.</u>
					4.24
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
